<main id="main">
  <section class="whero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Accessibility · Last updated 1 October 2026</p>
      <h1 class="display book__title" style="margin-top:24px">Built to be <em>read.</em></h1>
      <p class="book__lede" style="margin-top:28px">We want everyone to be able to use this site, whatever device, browser or assistive technology they use. We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA, the standard behind Ontario's AODA.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wsec">
    <div class="wrap wsec__grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we have done</p>
      <ul class="wrules">
        <li><b>Keyboard</b><span>Every link, button, menu and the self-check work from the keyboard, with a visible focus outline and a skip link to the main content.</span></li>
        <li><b>Motion</b><span>If your device asks for reduced motion, the intro, scroll effects, films and smooth scrolling switch off and still images take their place.</span></li>
        <li><b>Reading</b><span>Light text on black at high contrast, real headings in order, text that resizes to 200 percent, and descriptions on every meaningful image.</span></li>
        <li><b>Sound</b><span>Off by default. Nothing plays until you turn it on, and the films carry no speech.</span></li>
        <li><b>Screen readers</b><span>Pages are marked up with landmarks and labels, and the self-check announces your score when it finishes.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wsec">
    <div class="wrap wsec__grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">Where we fall short</p>
      <div class="wsec__text">
        <p>The booking calendar is provided by Calendly, inside a frame we do not control. If it gives you trouble, email us and we will book your call directly.</p>
        <p>Some decorative effects, such as the hero film and the grain texture, are visual only. They carry no information you would miss.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wsec">
    <div class="wrap wsec__grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">Tell us</p>
      <div class="wsec__text">
        <p>If anything on this site gets in your way, or you need something in another format, email <a class="link" href="mailto:sho@knght.com?subject=Accessibility">sho@knght.com</a>. We reply within 2 business days and fix what we can.</p>
        <p>We review the site against WCAG 2.2 AA whenever we make a significant change.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

